<title>POLAND: BOS MAY NET RISES TO PLN 4.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>BOS MAY NET RISES TO PLN 4.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.75 vs    0.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   10.64 vs    4.95</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 15.85 vs   10.89</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	21.79 vs   19.04</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 31.98 vs   17.98</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   51.41 vs   31.40</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 76.29 vs   51.58</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     100.25 vs   99.10</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Ochrony Srodowiska</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
